<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="fn" uri="jakarta.tags.functions" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Generate Questions with AI | OpenStudy</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/teacher-dashboard.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/question-bank.css"></head><body class="teacher-shell"><div class="layout"><jsp:include page="fragments/sidebar.jsp"/><div class="layout-main"><jsp:include page="fragments/navbar.jsp"/><main class="content qb-page"><a class="qb-back" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/teacher/question-bank">← Question Bank</a><h1>Generate Questions with AI</h1><p>Create question drafts with the configured AI provider, then review before saving.</p><div class="qb-ai-layout"><form id="generateForm" class="qb-card qb-form"><div class="qb-grid"><label class="qb-field">Subject *<select id="aiSubject" required><option value="">Loading subjects…</option></select></label><label class="qb-field">Topic *<input id="aiTopic" required maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Exception Handling"></label><label class="qb-field">Difficulty *<select id="aiDifficulty"><option value="EASY">Easy</option><option value="MEDIUM" selected>Medium</option><option value="HARD">Hard</option></select></label><label class="qb-field">Number of Questions *<input id="aiCount" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="5" required></label></div><label class="qb-field">Additional instructions (optional)<textarea id="aiInstructions" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Focus on real-world examples…"></textarea></label><p id="aiMessage" role="status"></p><button class="qb-button" id="generateButton">✦ Generate Questions</button></form><aside class="qb-card qb-info"><h2>AI Question Generator</h2><p>Questions are generated through your existing Groq integration. Review and edit each draft before saving it to your bank.</p><ul><li>Topic specific multiple choice questions</li><li>Correct answers and explanations included</li><li>Nothing is saved until you approve it</li></ul></aside></div><section class="qb-card" id="reviewPanel" hidden><h2>Review generated questions</h2><div id="generatedQuestions"></div><div class="qb-actions"><button id="regenerate" type="button" class="qb-light">Generate again</button><button id="saveSelected" type="button" class="qb-button">Save selected questions</button><a class="qb-light" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/teacher/question-bank">Cancel</a></div></section></main></div></div><script>window.OPENSTUDY_CONTEXT='${fn:escapeXml(pageContext.request.contextPath)}';</script><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/question-ai.js" defer></script></body></html>
